' Aus test_module_alias.py uebertragen (3 Faelle, aufgezeichnet 2026-09-08). Format: docs/werkzeuge.md, dhrt test.

=== alias in full program
' GB-Programm mit IMPORT-AS: aliasierte Builtins + externer Typ.
IMPORT "json" AS j
DIM h AS J_HANDLE
h = J_PARSE("[10,20,30]")
PRINT J_GET_INT(h, "0")
PRINT J_GET_INT(h, "1")
PRINT J_GET_INT(h, "2")
--- erwartet
10
20
30

=== alias does not break original names
' Alias ist additiv: die Original-Built-ins funktionieren weiter.
IMPORT "json" AS j
DIM h AS JSON_HANDLE
h = JSON_PARSE("[42]")
PRINT JSON_GET_INT(h, "0")
--- erwartet
42

=== alias with vec2 via program
' Vec2 mit Alias -- Built-ins, externer Typ und Operator-Registry.
IMPORT "vec2" AS v
DIM a AS V
a = V_NEW(3.0, 4.0)
PRINT V_LENGTH(a)
--- erwartet
5.0

